{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["<b>If you afflict my daughters.</b> From the affliction of marital relations. And if you say: I may take others in addition to them, and their conjugal rights I will not diminish — therefore he said <b>and if you take wives in addition to my daughters</b> — this is a second condition." "<b>There is no man with us.</b> Fit to testify."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:56.769438170Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}